# IONMIX-style 1T-only (NON-3T) EOS fixture for the [13b]/#10 rejection test.
# This table carries only a single matter species (nspec = 1: total energy/pressure,
# no separate electron/ion data), so the 2T/3T EOS reader MUST reject it with a clear
# error -- per ADR-0007 there is no 1T->2T split modelling.  The reader rejects on the
# header (nspec != 2), so the (illustrative) total-energy blocks below are never read.
#
# header: ntemp ndens nspec
       5        4        1
# temperature nodes [eV]
 1.0000000000000000e+00 1.0000000000000000e+01 1.0000000000000000e+02 1.0000000000000000e+03
 1.0000000000000000e+04
# density nodes [g/cc]
 1.0000000000000000e-03 1.0000000000000000e-02 1.0000000000000001e-01 1.0000000000000000e+00
# zbar[it][id]      (illustrative; not reached because the table is rejected on its header)
 1.5 2.0 2.5 3.0
 1.75 2.25 2.75 3.25
 2.0 2.5 3.0 3.5
 2.25 2.75 3.25 3.75
 2.5 3.0 3.5 4.0
# e_total[it][id]   (a 1T table carries only total internal energy, no e_ele/e_ion split)
 2.4 3.0 3.8 4.8
 24.0 30.0 38.0 48.0
 240.0 300.0 380.0 480.0
 2400.0 3000.0 3800.0 4800.0
 24000.0 30000.0 38000.0 48000.0
